hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1744","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Zubair (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Allah ne apne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko hukm diya ke wo logon key akhlaaq mein se maafi pakdey. (Bukhari: 4644). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur un se lado yahan tak ke fitna na rahey)."
